-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- Drop duplicate indexes flagged by the Supabase database linter\n-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- Five tables each had two byte-identical indexes (same columns, same order,\n-- same uniqueness/partial predicate). Keeping both wastes storage and slows\n-- writes. This migration drops the older/shorter-named duplicate from each\n-- pair; the surviving index has an identical definition so query plans are\n-- unchanged.\n-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\ndrop index if exists public.idx_debtors_business_status;\ndrop index if exists public.idx_expenses_business_date;\ndrop index if exists public.idx_quotations_business_status;\ndrop index if exists public.sales_business_offline_id_uniq;\ndrop index if exists public.idx_sar_business_status;\n","path":"supabase/migrations/20261031000001_drop_duplicate_indexes.sql"}